🚀 Render e Deploy korar dhap
GitHub e repo push shesh hole render.com e login koro.

Dashboard e New + e click koro -> Web Service select koro.

Tomar oi GitHub repo ta connect koro.

Form e ei jinish gulo set koro:

Name: terabox-solver (ba ja mon chay)

Region: Singapore (ba tomar kache jeta close)

Branch: main

Runtime: Docker (eta select kora khub important, Node/Python na)

Instance Type: Free select korte paro (kintu free hole 15 min por ghumai jabe, tokhon prothom request e ektu time lagbe. Paid $7/mo dile 24/7 cholbe).

Deploy Web Service e click koro.

Render nijei build korbe (5-7 minute lagbe). Shesh hole upore ekta URL pabe, jemon:
https://terabox-solver-xyz.onrender.com
